      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Charging the battery\nThe battery status indicator on the speaker blinks red when the battery needs charging.\nTo charge the battery, connect the speaker to AC power (see “Connecting to AC power” on page 7). The speaker emits a tone to confirm the power connection. Recommended charging time is three hours to fully charge the battery. The battery status indicator indicates the charging status. You can use the speaker while charging the battery.",
